                Important <span>On-Page SEO Elements</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                Key areas I am learning and practicing
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="seo-grid">


            <!-- KEYWORD -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-key"></i>

                <h3>
                    Keyword Research
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Finding relevant keywords that match the topic
                    of a webpage and understanding what users are
                    searching for.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- TITLE -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-tag"></i>

                <h3>
                    Title Tag
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Creating a clear and relevant title that
                    describes the main topic of a webpage.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- META -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-file-lines"></i>

                <h3>
                    Meta Description
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Writing a useful summary of the webpage content
                    that helps users understand what the page is about.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- HEADINGS -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-heading"></i>

                <h3>
                    H1, H2 & H3
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Using headings to organize content into a clear
                    and logical structure.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- URL -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-link"></i>

                <h3>
                    SEO-Friendly URLs
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Creating readable and descriptive URLs that
                    communicate the topic of a webpage.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- INTERNAL LINK -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-diagram-project"></i>

                <h3>
                    Internal Linking
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Linking related pages within the same website
                    to improve navigation and content discovery.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- IMAGE -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-image"></i>

                <h3>
                    Image SEO
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Optimizing images with descriptive file names,
                    suitable formats and meaningful alt text.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- CONTENT -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-pen"></i>

                <h3>
                    Content Optimization
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Creating useful, relevant and well-structured
                    content that provides value to the user.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- SEARCH INTENT -->

            <div class="seo-card">

                <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i>

                <h3>
                    Search Intent
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Understanding the reason behind a user's search
                    and creating content that addresses that need.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

